 "p-oboo-loob-arousal|pain.sexual": "Mayo Clinic lists cooling or tingling ingredients as products to avoid with vulvar pain, and this is an arousal product, not a pain remedy.",
 "p-oboo-loob-daily|pain.sexual": "A water-based daily vaginal moisturizer that fits the product type, but its ingredients are not disclosed.",
